# BAWAAL App Master Lock (LOCKED)

Production-final umbrella for all stabilized work through **BAWAAL LIVE** (2026-11-21) and earlier locked surfaces. Do **not** restyle, reorder, rewire, weaken permission gates, or regress soft-fail contracts unless the user **explicitly unlocks** this rule (`bawaal-app-master-locked.mdc`) **and** the matching feature lock below.

Detail contracts live in the sibling rules — this file is the **index + hard stop**. Prefer the feature lock for specifics; never treat silence here as permission to edit a locked surface.

