Authoritative detail: `bawaal-live-locked.mdc`

| Surface | Must keep |
|---|---|
| Hub (`LiveArenaModal`) | `+ GO LIVE NOW`; `JOIN WITH INVITE CODE` + `WATCH`; active telecast list; **no** multi-row sport chip grid |
